# Private run artifacts — NEVER commit.
# output/ contains real contract OCR text, page scans (PNG), and generated
# reports with verbatim clause quotes: employee name, addresses, salary figure,
# contract metadata. All of it is personal data (PII) — excluding the whole
# directory is the single required exclusion from the pre-release security audit
# (2026-08-22). Do not add exceptions here.
output/

# --- Environment & secrets ---
# Local configuration and secret material; never commit real credentials.
.env
.env.*

# --- Python ---
# Virtual environments and bytecode caches for the stdlib-only renderer
# (tools/render_report.py).
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- Editors / OS ---
# Local editor and OS droppings; machine-specific, no release value.
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.swp

# --- Logs ---
# Transient runtime logs; noise in a release repo.
*.log
